{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035010/extras/20c2a601336740f870bb3ed5f2cad361.avif?t=1773239947\" width=1149 height=185 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Team\u3011<br>This is a tower defense indie game developed by a core duo with additional support. Everyone worked on it part-time over the course of more than a year. Due to limited resources, the game may have its imperfections, but it represents our best effort under the circumstances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035010/extras/37ba333cad158e96a24a940dd7426a56.avif?t=1773239947\" width=1280 height=484 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Worldview\u3011<br>Set in the ancient Chinese underworld, every character\u2014from the Soup Attendants (towers) to the Souls (enemies)\u2014has a reason for being there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035010/extras/0dbab0b80d5e139fd039c3f67378bffd.avif?t=1773239947\" width=1371 height=421 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Gameplay\u3011<br>In this game, players can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instantly alter paths using anchor points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build towers freely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew the Pot of Oblivion with herbs to enhance tower stats and effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place talisman traps along paths to aid in defense.<br>Various map sizes, initial path challenges, and obstacles with different effects will test your strategic planning.<br>There\u2019s even more to discover\u2014we invite you to experience it for yourself!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Built","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4035010/bd131dc1418b23a91d20077f390fddeb33d319a9.jpg"},{"name":"First Kill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4035010/c576191a453f043998f9b47c86430640de9fdf82.jpg"},{"name":"Soup Serving Pro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4035010/c576191a453f043998f9b47c86430640de9fdf82.jpg"},{"name":"Statistician I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4035010/d123660fdc8b187b3edea92181cd3e0242139e21.jpg"},{"name":"Statistician II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4035010/5a4e78db6c8fc14bebd1fb4f3d21a3aec7b9fd49.jpg"},{"name":"Mind Like a Void","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4035010/4b61b2352bb51389c5b4bf658a57ebcb9e33c7f0.jpg"},{"name":"Attendance Check","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4035010/2f5284ba1b6ec4fb32c7bd4b7e300c46fbdad15b.jpg"},{"name":"Wolf's Ambition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4035010/f100229ae3d7640f17a1f8b49185d8c57843c967.jpg"},{"name":"The Foolish Child","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4035010/a6e97cf374a25ba52ed5ce35d700b1ee6f6268c9.jpg"},{"name":"Turbulence of Two Lives","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4035010/3afbedbcc9b492269eb6570e407ae3639ab37ee8.jpg"}],"total":48},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4035010?t=1773239947","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4